sovrn-os (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=low

  * Initial release of Sovrn OS
  * Mesh services: DHT, Identity, Presence, Feed, Message Queue
  * Central orchestrator: sovrnd (FastAPI on port 54771)
  * CDN agent with Sia/IPFS/Filecoin support
  * PWA hub (Preact) on port 54772
  * OOBE wizard (GTK4/libadwaita)
  * Yggdrasil mesh networking integration
  * .sovrn TLD DNS resolution
  * Self-signed CA bootstrap
  * nftables firewall
  - Caddy reverse proxy with JWT auth plugin

 -- Sovrn OS Team <team@sovrn.os>  Fri, 06 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0530
